# Loon remote rules: Spotify-US
# GitHub source: Gavin-L/loon-config
# Two-column syntax: policy is assigned in [Remote Rule] of your private local config.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,spotify.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,spotifycdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,spotifycdn.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,scdn.co
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pscdn.co
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,spoti.fi
